WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.040
It’s the clash of the titans: SCP-682,&nbsp;
the Hard to Destroy Reptile, vs SCP-096,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.560
the terrifying, murderous Shy&nbsp;
Guy. But who won this battle?

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.760
Well...It was kind of a draw. Their battle&nbsp;
lasted for 27 whole hours, and ended in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:21.040
a brutal stalemate, with SCP-096 severely&nbsp;
injured and huddled in one corner of the room,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:25.680
and 682 in the other, missing&nbsp;
85% of its original body mass.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:29.040
The creatures were both brought back&nbsp;
to their chambers with relative ease.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:35.760
A fight like this can never happen again, because&nbsp;
now, whenever 096 is brought too close to 682,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.080
it turns away, shrieks, and&nbsp;
begins clawing at its own face.

